; Bank $1E -- screen pre-draw helper
4000 ScreenPreDraw       ; called before most screen draws (ScreenDrawDispatch prologue)

; --- context-based names (callee-derived role; Func/Proc = purpose TBD) ---
79FA GfxFillVramRegions         ; write $ff to VRAM $9480-$97FF and $8800-$88CF (via $17ec vblank tile writer)
7A38 GfxReadVramByte            ; wait for safe LCD access (rSTAT mode), read [de], return byte in e
7A4B GfxCopyVramRegion          ; copy bytes between VRAM regions (GfxReadVramByte -> $17ec writer), 16-step outer loop
; --- indirect (FarCall) target ---
7AA0 InitScreenPalettes ; ResetDisplayState, then set wShadow/SelectDigitPal + wShadow/SelectPal (CGB), load palette data
